  "prefLabel": "App 102.10 Registration of an apprenticeship program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.10 \"Registration of an apprenticeship program\" means the acceptance and recording of such program by the council as meeting the basic standards and requirement of these rules and of 29 CFR 29 and 29 CFR 30.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
